[h1]Phobos Agriculture 0.19.0[/h1]
[b]Draft - not published | 2026-09-29[/b]

[h2]Changed[/h2]

[list]
[*]The W2 water supply, B2 workup bench and R3 reservoir gain the Firstlight-4 and Hearth-2's second-hand routes: lightly worn at the K-Leg fixer, refurbished and broken at the Venus Orbital scrap kiosk. R3 offers come in lots of four, the others in lots of eight.
[/list]

[h2]Compatibility and limits[/h2]

[list]
[*]Framework 0.39.0 is still the minimum. Prices, bills, salvage and saves are unchanged, and the R3 stays purchase-only. New offers appear at normal restocks; existing shop inventories are not refilled. See the [url=https://github.com/phobos-dthorga/phobos-ostranauts/blob/main/docs/development/economy-coverage-audit.md]economy coverage audit[/url].
[/list]
